<title>FRANCE: Chretien leaves France after three-day visit.</title>
<headline>Chretien leaves France after three-day visit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Prime Minister Jean Chretien left Paris on Friday after a three-day visit to France during which he met President Jacques Chirac and other leaders.</p>
<p>Chretien's special flight left shortly after 8 a.m. (0700 GMT), airport officials said.</p>
